    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1132">

                <pb facs="0939" n="823" sameAs="frus:frus1912/pg823"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/4522.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The American Ambassador to the Secretary of
                    State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Embassy</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1912-07-30T18:00:00-06:36">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">July 30, 1912—6 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>In accordance with your July 29, 4 p.m., I have forwarded your July 28, midnight,
                    to the Consul at Chihuahua, and added following: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>The Department subsequently instructed the Embassy to instruct you to do
                            all you can to alleviate conditions and to send Department your
                            recommendations as soon as possible. The authority lodged in you hereby
                            should be used <pb facs="0940" n="824" xml:id="pg824"/> without
                            hesitation if conditions exist with you similar to those reported by
                            Consul Edwards. When and where necessary act on Department’s March 2, 2
                            p.m.</p>
                    </quote>
                </p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
